efix opening — proving the request begins with the commitment without revealing the strategy — is a candidate extension, not a shipped claim.\"}]]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":[[\"rect\",{\"width\":\"18\",\"height\":\"11\",\"x\":\"3\",\"y\":\"11\",\"rx\":\"2\",\"ry\":\"2\",\"key\":\"1w4ew1\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\",\"key\":\"fwvmzm\"}]],\"className\":\"lucide-lock text-muted-foreground size-4 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],\"Stricter than the reference client\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"0G’s own SDK does not recompute the hashes: it trusts the signed text the provider returns and only recovers a signer from it. Fief recomputes the response hash on-chain and rebuilds that text from the actual request and response bytes before recovery. A provider returning text that does not match the real bytes passes the reference client and fails here.\"}]]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$b:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-triangle-alert text-muted-foreground size-4 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],\"Residual risks, not denied\"]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"select-none\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Observing an agent’s outputs over a long period may allow a renter to approximate its behaviour. This is a documented residual risk, mitigated by rate limits and disclosure-delay options, not eliminated.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"select-none\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The ERC-7857 reference verifier this build forks is permissive: mint and update accept any 32-byte hash, and transfer validity checks only a receiver signature plus a replay replay nonce. Fief claims no cryptographic mint or transfer security from it. Record integrity is independent — the ledger is keyed by token and is untouched by transfer.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"select-none\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"An operator key compromise would let an attacker append junk entries until the key is rotated. Rotation does not affect the epoch, and entries carry the signer that produced them.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\",\"children\":[null,\"Non-goals\"]}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"No custody or execution of renter funds.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"select-none\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"No custody or execution of renter funds.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"No claim of alpha or profit-and-loss verification. Provenance only.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"select-none\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"No claim of alpha or profit-and-loss verification. Provenance only.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"No token, no governance, no royalties.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"select-none\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"No token, no governance, no royalties.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"No TeeTLS providers — in those the model is not inside the TEE.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"select-none\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"No TeeTLS providers — in those the model is not inside the TEE.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"No ZKML or OPML claims.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"select-none\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"No ZKML or OPML claims.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"No multi-chain.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"select-none\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"No multi-chain.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"No custody and no execution of renter funds. Trade execution stays with the renter.\",\" \",\"Fief proves provenance, not profitability. A record shows which sealed model produced which decision — it is not evidence that the decisions were good.\"]}]]]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold track